Package: LDdecay
Title: Advanced Tools for Linkage Disequilibrium Decay and Functional Mapping
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Mohammad Shamim [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Mohammad Shamim <your.email@example.com>
Description: A collection of optimized tools for calculation, grouping, and advanced visualization 
    of global genome-wide linkage disequilibrium (LD) decay profiles, regional block tracking, 
    and fast overlapping variant-to-gene mapping from standardized GFF3 annotations.
